# Reverse-engineering workspace, local-only. `extracted/` and `krlauncher/` are
# the official Kuro installer payload (vendor binaries, launcher.exe/uninst.exe),
# `decompiled/` and `feapp/` are decompiled sources and fetched server manifests,
# and `tools/` is a vendored ILSpy NuGet package. None of it is project source;
# the findings derived from it are committed under docs/ instead.
reverse-engineer/extracted/
reverse-engineer/krlauncher/
reverse-engineer/decompiled/
reverse-engineer/feapp/
reverse-engineer/tools/

